!> Owned actual sorted identities, compact stack edits and completed scan chains. lower/upper contain
!> indices into sorted and include their endpoints. Inputs with fewer than two distinct points take no
!> scans and have empty chains/events. Trace capture performs no extra sorting or orientation replay.
