!>
!> - A. Beck and M. Teboulle (2009), A Fast Iterative Shrinkage-Thresholding Algorithm for Linear
!>   Inverse Problems, https://doi.org/10.1137/080716542
!>
!> See also: `FISTAOptions`, `trace_optimize()`.
type, extends(rosetta_object), public :: FISTA
contains
    !> Run FISTA from the supplied point using the configured finite budget. Classical t recurrence
    !> (1+sqrt(1+4*t^2))/2 and extrapolated gradient points, followed by the supplied proximal map. Stops
    !> on successive accepted-coordinate displacement. No adaptive restart, backtracking or monotonicity
    !> safeguard. Supply the correct proximal dimensions and a rate at most 1/L for the standard convex
    !> bound.
    procedure :: optimize => fista_optimize
    !> Borrow this optimizer's stored configuration.
    procedure :: options => fista_options
end type

