    !> Gets C++ field `armijo_c1`: Sufficient-decrease fraction in (0,1). Default 1e-4.
    procedure :: get_armijo_c1 => lbfgsoptions_get_armijo_c1
    !> Sets C++ field `armijo_c1`: Sufficient-decrease fraction in (0,1). Default 1e-4.
