    !> Gets C++ field `noise`: Observation-noise variance added to the kernel diagonal. When fitting, the
    !> ratio noise / signal_variance (the nugget) is what stays fixed.
    procedure :: get_noise => gaussianprocesssurrogateoptions_get_noise
    !> Sets C++ field `noise`: Observation-noise variance added to the kernel diagonal. When fitting, the
    !> ratio noise / signal_variance (the nugget) is what stays fixed.
    procedure :: set_noise => gaussianprocesssurrogateoptions_set_noise
