!> SimulatedAnnealing on the ArbitraryFunction callback interface. Gaussian random-walk proposals with
!> geometrically decaying temperature and Metropolis acceptance of worse values. Returns the best
!> visited point, not the last accepted state. A finite cooling schedule does not certify a global
