!> **References**
!>
!> - S. Kirkpatrick, C. D. Gelatt and M. P. Vecchi (1983), Optimization by Simulated Annealing,
!>   https://doi.org/10.1126/science.220.4598.671. Finite geometric cooling here supplies no global
!> guarantee.
!>
!> See also: `SimulatedAnnealingOptions`, `trace_optimize()`.
type, extends(rosetta_object), public :: SimulatedAnnealing
contains
