    !> Sets C++ field `p_value`: Null-reference p-value, not adjusted for multiple testing.
    procedure :: set_p_value => hypothesistestresult_set_p_value
    !> Gets C++ field `estimate1`: First test-specific estimate, such as a mean, ratio or correlation.
