!> An owned B-rep solid with value-returning modelling and export operations. Geometry uses doubles in
!> caller-selected consistent units. Copies own topology; immutable surfaces may be shared. Operations
!> return new solids, preserving inputs. Unsupported kernel operations throw std::runtime_error with
!> the kernel diagnostic. Concurrent const access is safe; do not mutate a shared object concurrently.
!>
!> **Example**
!>
!> ```
!> auto block = dm::cad::Solid::box(4, 3, 2);
!> auto hole = dm::cad::Solid::cylinder(.4, 4).translated(2, 1.5, -1);
!> auto part = block.subtracted(hole);
!> part.save("part.step");
!> ```
