!> Adds vertical bars centered at arbitrary x positions, the low-level form behind barplot() and hist()
!> (R's `rect()` from 0 to each height).
!>
!> Bar i spans x[i] +/- bar_width / 2 and rises from 0 to y[i] (negative heights point
