!> ```
!>
!> @param level Level.
!> @param index Multi-index.
!> @return Activity flag.
!> @throws std::out_of_range For invalid levels/indices.
!> @throws std::invalid_argument On a dimension mismatch.
recursive function truncatedhierarchicalbspline_is_active(self, level, index, status) result(rs_res)
    class(TruncatedHierarchicalBSpline), intent(in) :: self
