!> Reduces p modulo `basis` (repeated division: subtract a multiple of whichever basis element's
!> leading term divides p's current leading term, moving undivided leading terms into the remainder)
!> until nothing is left, returning the remainder.
!>
!> @param p
!> @param basis
!> @param order
recursive function reduce_1(p, basis, order, status) result(rs_res)
    class(MultivariatePolynomial), intent(in) :: p
