!> `n` colours from dark blue through white to dark red, a diverging palette for signed values such as
!> correlations (ColorBrewer's RdBu, reversed so that low is blue).
!>
!> Interpolates linearly between the seven RdBu anchor colours; an odd `n` puts pure
!> near-white (247, 247, 247) in the middle, so with `z_min = -z_max` in RPlot::image() zero
!> maps to white.
